    {
      "id": "e001013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 352,
      "y": 137.6,
      "width": 236.2265625,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "• 不改 term / 不持久化\n• 只比较日志新旧(up_to_date)\n• 防扰动候选者乱涨 term（分区后旧leader）\n• 过半数才进正式投票",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
