      "type": "text",
      "x": 352,
      "y": 497.6,
      "width": 266,
      "height": 94,
      "text": "两用：\n• 空心跳：leader 维持权威\n  (含 read_ctx 给 ReadIndex 用)\n• 带日志：matchIndex/nextIndex\n  推进 commitIndex\n回包 ok=true→清 cq/刷 last_ack_time_",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "两用：\n• 空心跳：leader 维持权威\n  (含 read_ctx 给 ReadIndex 用)\n• 带日志：matchIndex/nextIndex\n  推进 commitIndex\n回包 ok=true→清 cq/刷 last_ack_time_",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
