    {
      "id": "e001028",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 692,
      "y": 327.6,
      "width": 267.33984375,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "• 每读请求判断身份是否为新leader(防旧leader)\n• 发带 read_ctx 空心跳（read_ctx用来使Get请求\n  可以并发执行，raft会为每个请求发送唯一递增ctx\n  号）\n• 收多数follower回应且大于read_safe_index可读\n  commitIndex.\n• 必须等 lastApplied>=ri (commitindex)才读\n• 孤立旧 leader 靠超时兜底(坑D)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 每读请求判断身份是否为新leader(防旧leader)\n• 发带 read_ctx 空心跳（read_ctx用来使Get请求\n  可以并发执行，raft会为每个请求发送唯一递增ctx\n  号）\n• 收多数follower回应且大于read_safe_index可读\n  commitIndex.\n• 必须等 lastApplied>=ri (commitindex)才读\n• 孤立旧 leader 靠超时兜底(坑D)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
