      "type": "text",
      "x": 692,
      "y": 557.6,
      "width": 215.666015625,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "• Snapshot(): mu_ 内截断 logs_\n• SaveSnapshotBlob: snap_io_mu_ 锁外\n  fsync(两阶段落盘)\n• saved_blob_index_ 单调防覆盖\n• 锁序 snap_io_mu_→mu_ 唯一\n  (防饿死心跳/死锁 坑B/J)\n• 持久化kvmap",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Snapshot(): mu_ 内截断 logs_\n• SaveSnapshotBlob: snap_io_mu_ 锁外\n  fsync(两阶段落盘)\n• saved_blob_index_ 单调防覆盖\n• 锁序 snap_io_mu_→mu_ 唯一\n  (防饿死心跳/死锁 坑B/J)\n• 持久化kvmap",
